Usa `fallos` de 0 a 5:
```java
static void dibujar(int fallos) {
    System.out.printf(" +---+%n |   |%n%s%n%s%n%s%n=======%n",
        fallos > 0 ? " O   |" : "     |",
        fallos > 2 ? "/|\\  |" : fallos > 1 ? "/|   |" : fallos > 0 ? " |   |" : "     |",
        fallos > 4 ? "/ \\  |" : fallos > 3 ? "/    |" : "     |");
}
```
